@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@spotId = 21110b2c-6f01-4684-9a60-fda4410afd43

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Criar spot
POST {{baseUrl}}/spots
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "lat": "4.2726784",
    "lon": "73.5132004",
    "alias": "Pico da colina Maldivas",
    "description": "Vista em cima de uma cachoeira de uma praia reluzente ao por do sol",
    "address": "R. Abdul, 55632 EAST"
}

### Buscar spots por raio
GET {{baseUrl}}/spots?lat=4.2766985&lon=73.51321006&radius=5000

### Atualizar spot
PUT {{baseUrl}}/spots/{{spotId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "alias": "Pico da neblina"
}

### Deletar spot
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/spots/{{spotId}}

### Gerar presigned URL para upload
# @name presigned
POST {{baseUrl}}/spots/{{spotId}}/images/presigned
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
    "sizeBytes": 15728640,
    "originalName": "photo.jpeg"
}

### Upload da imagem (cole a uploadUrl retornada acima)
PUT {{presigned.response.body.uploadUrl}}
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.png

### Confirmar upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/spots/{{spotId}}/images/{{presigned.response.body.imageId}}/confirm

### Listar imagens do spot
GET {{baseUrl}}/spots/{{spotId}}/images

